ly be called once. This function MUST only be called by owner().","params":{"globals":"Array of addresses representing all core system contracts.","stablecoins":"Array of stablecoins representing initial acceptable stablecoins."}},"owner()":{"details":"Returns the address of the current owner."},"proposeZVL(address)":{"details":"This function MUST only be called by ZVL().","params":{"_proposedZVL":"The proposed address for ZVL."}},"renounceOwnership()":{"details":"Leaves the contract without owner. It will not be possible to call `onlyOwner` functions anymore. Can only be called by the current owner. NOTE: Renouncing ownership will leave the contract without an owner, thereby removing any functionality that is only available to the owner."},"standardize(uint256,address)":{"params":{"amount":"The amount of a given \"asset\".","asset":"The asset (ERC-20) from which to standardize the amount to WEI."},"returns":{"standardizedAmount":" The input \"amount\" standardized to 18 decimals."}},"transferOwnership(address)":{"details":"Transfers ownership of the contract to a new account (`newOwner`). Can only be called by the current owner."},"updateIsDepositor(address,bool)":{"details":"This function MUST only be called by ZVL().","params":{"depositor":"The address of the depositor.","status":"The status to assign to the \"depositor\" (true = allowed, false = restricted)."}},"updateIsKeeper(address,bool)":{"details":"This function MUST only be called by ZVL().","params":{"keeper":"The address of the keeper.","status":"The status to assign to the \"keeper\" (true = allowed, false = restricted)."}},"updateIsLocker(address,bool)":{"details":"This function MUST only be called by ZVL().","params":{"locker":"The locker to update.","status":"The status to assign to the \"locker\" (true = permitted, false = prohibited)."}},"updateStablecoinWhitelist(address,bool)":{"details":"This function MUST only be called by ZVL().","params":{"allowed":"The value to assign (true = permitted, fals